$ Rosa Stage-4 scaffolding: Israel coarse grid, SYNTHETIC boundary proof-run.
$ Not a forecast. Forces a canonical 1.5 m / 8 s / W JONSWAP on the west (deep,
$ ~1100 m) boundary + 5 m/s W wind, stationary, and tables Hs/Tp/Dir at every
$ Israeli spot's nearshore point (points.loc). Real Stage-4 runs swap the
$ constant boundary for Stage-3 spectra and this grid for finer nests.
PROJ 'rosa' 'IL1'
SET NAUTICAL
MODE STATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES SPHERICAL
CGRID REGULAR 34.0 31.5 0. 1.20 1.70 120 170 CIRCLE 36 0.04 0.5 25
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 34.0 31.5 0. 120 170 0.01 0.01
READINP BOTTOM 1. 'bot.grd' 3 0 FREE
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE W CONSTANT PAR 1.5 8. 270. 20.
WIND 5. 270.
GEN3
BREAKING
FRICTION JONSWAP
NUM ACCUR 0.02 0.02 0.02 98. STAT 50
POINTS 'SPOTS' FILE 'points.loc'
TABLE 'SPOTS' HEAD 'spots.tab' XP YP DEP HSIGN TPS DIR
COMPUTE
STOP
